#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.rrshift:1 of
msgid "Reverse element-wise right bit shift (``other >> lf``)."
msgstr "反向逐元素右位移（``other >> lf``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.rrshift:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to ``__rrshift__``, so ``other >> lf`` is equivalent to "
"``lf.rrshift(other)``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``__rrshift__``，所以 ``other >> lf`` 等价于 ``lf.rrshift(other)``"
"。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.rrshift of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.rrshift:6 of
msgid "Integer value shifted right by each element of ``lf``."
msgstr "被 ``lf`` 的每个元素右移的整数值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.rrshift of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.rrshift:9 of
msgid "Lazy frame with ``other`` shifted right by each element of ``lf``."
msgstr "带有 ``other`` 被 ``lf`` 的每个元素右移的惰性框架。"

